  "isolationRationale": "No provider/session/service calls. The tests create only test-owned os.tmpdir trees, chmod directories, create/remove proper-lockfile lock directories, write/fsync/rename agent-sessions.json plus backup/temp files, reopen those files, and remove all test trees in afterEach. proper-lockfile registers an exit cleanup listener at module load and uses short unref'd update timers while locks are held; every acquired lock is released in finally. Imported child-process/Windows helpers are definition-only on this Darwin run and are not invoked."
